<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  td, th {
    padding: 8px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .header {
    font-weight: bold;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin: 0;">Chemical Satellite Accumulation Area</h1>
    <h2 style="font-size: 18pt; margin-top: 5px;">Monthly Inspection</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">REVIEW QUESTIONS</div>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 5%;">YES</th>
        <th style="width: 5%;">NO</th>
        <th style="width: 5%;">N/A</th>
        <th style="width: 90%;">Question</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td>1. Is chemical waste accumulated in this area?</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td>2. Are waste containers properly labeled with a "Hazardous Waste" sticker, accumulation start date, and chemical names in English?</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td>3. Have all EPA waste codes been identified for each container? (See the back of this form for more information.)</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td>4. Is each container marked with the appropriate hazard? (Examples: Corrosive, Flammable, Oxidizer, etc.)</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td>5. Does the accumulation start date indicate that the waste is older than 6 months? (If yes, contact your department's Chemical Hygiene Officer.)</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td>6. Are hazardous waste containers in good condition? (Examples: Free of leakage, spillage, bulging, rust, etc.)</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td>7. Are containers closed, except when adding waste?</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td>8. Are incompatible wastes and/or materials separated or protected by physical means such as a wall, cabinet, or secondary container?</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td>9. Are waste bottles stored in secondary containers?</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td>10. Are chemical spill supplies available?</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="section-title">DATE INSPECTED</div>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Jan</th>
        <th>Feb</th>
        <th>Mar</th>
        <th>Apr</th>
        <th>May</th>
        <th>Jun</th>
        <th>Jul</th>
        <th>Aug</th>
        <th>Sept</th>
        <th>Oct</th>
        <th>Nov</th>
        <th>Dec</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="date_inspected_jan">{{ date_inspected_jan }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="date_inspected_feb">{{ date_inspected_feb }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="date_inspected_mar">{{ date_inspected_mar }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="date_inspected_apr">{{ date_inspected_apr }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="date_inspected_may">{{ date_inspected_may }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="date_inspected_jun">{{ date_inspected_jun }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="date_inspected_jul">{{ date_inspected_jul }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="date_inspected_aug">{{ date_inspected_aug }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="date_inspected_sept">{{ date_inspected_sept }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="date_inspected_oct">{{ date_inspected_oct }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="date_inspected_nov">{{ date_inspected_nov }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="date_inspected_dec">{{ date_inspected_dec }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="section-title">DEPARTMENT CHEMICAL HYGIENE OFFICERS</div>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 20%;">Name</th>
        <th style="width: 20%;">Phone Number</th>
        <th style="width: 30%;">Department</th>
        <th style="width: 30%;">Location</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for officer in officers %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="officers[{{ loop.index0 }}].name">{{ officer.name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="officers[{{ loop.index0 }}].phone_number">{{ officer.phone_number }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="officers[{{ loop.index0 }}].department">{{ officer.department }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="officers[{{ loop.index0 }}].location">{{ officer.location }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>
</body>
</html>